{
  "type": "scene",
  "id": "main",
  "root": {
    "type": "scaffold",
    "id": "root",
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "appbar",
        "id": "bar",
        "label": "Backend Demo"
      },
      {
        "type": "column",
        "id": "body",
        "style": {
          "padding": 20,
          "gap": 16
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "card",
            "id": "card",
            "style": {
              "padding": 18,
              "gap": 6,
              "borderRadius": 12
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "id": "lbl",
                "text": "Cat Fact",
                "style": {
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": 700,
                  "color": "var(--label2)"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "id": "fact",
                "text": "{{state.resp.fact}}",
                "style": {
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "color": "var(--label)"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "row",
            "id": "busy",
            "if": "{{ state.loading }}",
            "style": {
              "gap": 8
            },
            "layout": {
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "spinner",
                "id": "busy_spin",
                "size": 16
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "id": "busy_lbl",
                "text": "Calling the backend…",
                "style": {
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "color": "var(--label2)"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "err",
            "text": "{{state.err}}",
            "style": {
              "fontSize": 13,
              "color": "var(--danger)"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "button",
            "id": "go",
            "label": "New Cat Fact (blocking)",
            "variant": "filled",
            "onPress": {
              "type": "invoke",
              "name": "getFact",
              "args": {}
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "button",
            "id": "goasync",
            "label": "New Cat Fact (async)",
            "variant": "outlined",
            "onPress": {
              "type": "invoke",
              "name": "getFactAsync",
              "args": {}
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "hint",
            "text": "The async button hands the request to a background worker and returns at once — keep tapping the counter below while it is still loading. The blocking one paints its spinner with a 'render' step, then holds the session until the reply lands.",
            "style": {
              "fontSize": 12,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "color": "var(--label2)"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "button",
            "id": "tapper",
            "label": "Still responsive: {{state.taps}} taps",
            "variant": "text",
            "onPress": {
              "type": "invoke",
              "name": "tap",
              "args": {}
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "divider",
            "id": "dv_search"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "searchlbl",
            "text": "Search-as-you-type (deduplicated)",
            "style": {
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": 700,
              "color": "var(--label2)"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "input",
            "id": "q",
            "placeholder": "Type a product name…",
            "value": "{{state.q}}",
            "onChange": {
              "type": "invoke",
              "name": "searchProducts",
              "args": {}
            },
            "style": {
              "background": "var(--surface)",
              "height": 44,
              "padding": {
                "left": 14
              },
              "borderRadius": 10,
              "borderWidth": 1,
              "borderColor": "var(--sep)"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "row",
            "id": "searching",
            "if": "{{ state.searching }}",
            "style": {
              "gap": 8
            },
            "layout": {
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "spinner",
                "id": "searching_spin",
                "size": 14
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "id": "searching_lbl",
                "text": "Searching…",
                "style": {
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "color": "var(--label2)"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "searchhits",
            "text": "Matches: {{state.hits.total}}",
            "style": {
              "fontSize": 15,
              "color": "var(--label)"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "searcherr",
            "text": "{{state.searchErr}}",
            "style": {
              "fontSize": 13,
              "color": "var(--danger)"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "searchhint",
            "text": "Every keystroke fires a request with \"key\": \"search\", so a new one cancels whichever is still open — only the LAST keystroke's reply is ever written. \"pending\": \"searching\" drives the spinner (no hand-written flag, and it clears on failure too), and \"timeout\": 4000 caps the round trip at 4s instead of the default 20s.",
            "style": {
              "fontSize": 12,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "color": "var(--label2)"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "divider",
            "id": "dv"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "camlbl",
            "text": "Hardware: Camera",
            "style": {
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": 700,
              "color": "var(--label2)"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "camera",
            "id": "cam",
            "value": "{{state.photo}}",
            "label": "拍照 / Take Photo"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
